{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-p064a","title":"汉帝遣守尚书令侍中觊劝魏王即位","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-p064a-account","label":"裴注·献帝传","text":"汉帝遣守尚书令侍中觊劝魏王即位","evidence":["wendi-e-p064a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0054","role":"遣使","evidence":["wendi-e-p064a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0118","role":"传谕","evidence":["wendi-e-p064a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年十月庚午","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年十月庚午"},"evidence":["wendi-e-p064a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-p064a-q","source_order":[2,177,"P064a"],"order":552}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0118","name":"觊（禅位使臣）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0054","name":"汉献帝","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-p064a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-972c6ee5d1677be6b3d4","layer":"pei","quote":"庚午，册诏魏王曰：“昔尧以配天之德，秉六合之重；犹睹历运之数，移于有虞，委让帝位，忽如遗迹。今天既讫我汉命，乃眷北顾；帝皇之业，实在大魏。朕守空名，以窃古义；顾视前事，犹有惭德。而王逊让，至于三四，朕用惧焉。夫不辞万乘之位者，知命达节之数也；虞、夏之君，处之不疑。故勋烈垂于万载，美名传于无穷。今遣守尚书令、侍中（顗）〔觊〕喻，王其速陟帝位，以顺天人之心，副朕之大愿！”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fc6f9c6942b5c231c294","start":0,"end":185},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
